#: KWConfig.cpp:274
msgid "&Units:"
msgstr "&Eenheiten:"

#: KWConfig.cpp:280
msgid ""
"Select the unit type used every time a distance or width/height is displayed or "
"entered. This one setting is for the whole of KWord: all dialogs, the rulers "
"etc. Note that KWord documents specify the unit which was used to create them, "
"so this setting only affects this document and all documents that will be "
"created later."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik de Eenheit utsöken, de jümmers för't Wiesen oder de Ingaav vun "
"Afstänn, Breden un Hööchden bruukt warrt. Disse Instellen gellt för all Angaven "
"binnen KWord. All Dialogen, Linealen usw. Beacht, dat KWord-Dokmenten de "
"Eenheiten angeevt, mit de se opstellt wöörn, so dat disse Instellen bloots för "
"dit Dokment un all later opstellt Dokmenten gellt."

#: KWConfig.cpp:287
msgid "Show &status bar"
msgstr "&Statusbalken wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:289
msgid ""
"Show or hide the status bar. If enabled, the status bar is shown at the bottom, "
"which displays various information."
msgstr ""
"Statusbalken wiesen oder versteken. Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt nerrn de "
"Statusbalken mit verscheden Informatschonen wiest."

#: KWConfig.cpp:291
msgid "Show s&crollbar"
msgstr "&Rullbalken wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:293
msgid ""
"Show or hide the scroll bar. If enabled, the scroll bar is shown on the right "
"and lets you scroll up and down, which is useful for navigating through the "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Rullbalken anmaken oder versteken. Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt rechterhand de "
"Rullbalken wiest un lett sik hooch- un daalrullen, wat goot för de "
"Navigatschoon binnen dat Dokment is."

#: KWConfig.cpp:295
msgid "PageUp/PageDown &moves the caret"
msgstr "SietRop / SietDaal &beweegt den Blinker"

#: KWConfig.cpp:298
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the PageUp and PageDown keys move the text caret, as "
"in other KDE applications. If it is disabled, they move the scrollbars, as in "
"most other word processors."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, beweegt de Tasten \"SietRop\" un \"SietDaal\" den Blinker, "
"as in anner KDE-Programmen. Wenn dit utmaakt is, beweegt se den Rullbalken, as "
"in de mehrsten anner Textprogrammen."

#: KWConfig.cpp:303
msgid ""
"The number of files remembered in the file open dialog and in the recent files "
"menu item."
msgstr ""
"De Tall vun Dateien binnen den Dialoog \"Datei opmaken\" un binnen den "
"Menüpunkt \"Verleden opmaken\"."

#: KWConfig.cpp:305
msgid "Number of recent &files:"
msgstr "Tall vun tolest bruukte &Dateien:"

#: KWConfig.cpp:313
msgid ""
"The grid size on which frames, tabs and other content snaps while moving and "
"scaling."
msgstr ""
"De Gaddergrött för't Andocken vun Rahmens, Tabulatoren un anner Inholden bi't "
"Verschuven un Topassen."

#: KWConfig.cpp:315
msgid "&Horizontal grid size:"
msgstr "&Waagrecht Gaddergrött:"

#: KWConfig.cpp:327
msgid ""
"The grid size on which frames and other content snaps while moving and scaling."
msgstr ""
"De Gaddergrött för't Andocken vun Rahmens un anner Inholden bi't Verschuven un "
"Topassen."

#: KWConfig.cpp:329
msgid "&Vertical grid size:"
msgstr "&Pielliek Gaddergrött:"

#: KWConfig.cpp:342
msgid ""
"Configure the indent width used when using the 'Increase' or 'Decrease' "
"indentation buttons on a paragraph."
"<p>The lower the value, the more often the buttons will have to be pressed to "
"gain the same indentation."
msgstr ""
"De Inrückbreed för de Knööp \"Mehr inrücken\" oder \"Weniger inrücken\" "
"fastleggen."
"<p> Wenn lütter Weerten instellt sünd, mööt de Knööp för den sülven Afstand "
"fakener drückt warrn."

#: KWConfig.cpp:346
msgid "&Paragraph indent by toolbar buttons:"
msgstr "&Afsnitt-Inrücken mit Warktüüchbalken-Knööp:"

#: KWConfig.cpp:358
msgid ""
"After selecting Preview Mode (from the \"View\" menu,) this is the number of "
"pages KWord will position on one horizontal row."
msgstr ""
"In'n Vöransichtbedrief (Utwahl in't Menü \"Ansicht\") is dit de Tall vun "
"Sieden, de in een waagrecht Reeg wiest warrt."

#: KWConfig.cpp:361
msgid "Number of pa&ges per row in preview mode:"
msgstr "Tall vun &Sieden per Reeg in'n Vöransichtbedrief:"

#: KWConfig.cpp:504
msgid "Undo/&redo limit:"
msgstr "Grenz för Torüchnehmen/&Wedderhalen:"

#: KWConfig.cpp:505
msgid ""
"Limit the number of undo/redo actions remembered. A lower value helps to save "
"memory, a higher value allows you to undo and redo more editing steps."
msgstr ""
"De Grenz för Torüchnehmen/Wedderhalen fastleggen. Mit sieter Weerten lett sik "
"Spieker sporen, mit höger Weerten laat sik mehr Bewerken-Schreed torüchnehmen "
"un wedderhalen."

#: KWConfig.cpp:515
msgid "Display &links"
msgstr "&Links wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:517
msgid ""
"If enabled, a link is highlighted as such and is clickable.\n"
"\n"
"You can insert a link from the Insert menu."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt en Link markeert un is anklickbor.\n"
"\n"
"Mit dat Menü \"Infögen\" lett sik en Link infögen."

#: KWConfig.cpp:519
msgid "&Underline all links"
msgstr "All Links ünner&streken"

#: KWConfig.cpp:521
msgid "If enabled, a link is underlined."
msgstr "Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt en Link ünnerstreken."

#: KWConfig.cpp:523
msgid "Display c&omments"
msgstr "&Kommentaren wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:525
msgid ""
"If enabled, comments are indicated by a small yellow box.\n"
"\n"
"You can show and edit a comment from the context menu."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt Kommentaren mit en lütt geel Punkt markeert.\n"
"\n"
"Kommentaren laat sik mit dat Rechtsklickmenü wiesen un bewerken."

#: KWConfig.cpp:528
msgid "Display field code"
msgstr "Feldkode wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:530
msgid ""
"If enabled, the type of link is displayed instead of displaying the link text.\n"
"\n"
"There are various types of link that can be inserted, such as hyperlinks, "
"files, mail, news and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Link-Typ ansteed den Link-Text wiest.\n"
"\n"
"Dat gifft verscheden Linkoorden, as t.B. Hyperlinks, Dateien, Nettpost, "
"Narichten un Leestekens, de sik infögen laat."

#: KWConfig.cpp:536
msgid "View Formatting"
msgstr "Formateren wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:537
msgid ""
"These settings can be used to select the formatting characters that should be "
"shown.\n"
"\n"
"Note that the selected formatting characters are only shown if formatting "
"characters are enabled in general, which can be done from the View menu."
msgstr ""
"Disse Instellen laat sik för't Markeren vun Formaterentekens bruken, de wiest "
"warrn schöölt.\n"
"\n"
"Beacht, dat de markeert Formaterentekens bloots wiest warrt, wenn "
"Formaterentekens allgemeen in't Menü \"Ansicht\" anmaakt sünd."

#: KWConfig.cpp:550
msgid "View formatting end paragraph"
msgstr "Formaterenteken för Afsnitt-Ennen wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:553
msgid "View formatting space"
msgstr "Formaterenteken för Freetekens wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:556
msgid "View formatting tabs"
msgstr "Formaterenteken för Tabulatoren wiesen"

#: KWConfig.cpp:559
